    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avery Stardust, an enigmatic automaton, is trapped in the mysterious Global Psychometric Assessment Program with a chilling sentence: death in 17 days unless He can recall his reset code, A 6 letter code is all that stands between life and death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/cf6310e81a881ab031b85c7ed9a62255.avif?t=1754921123\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Days in Prison</strong>: Experience the mysteries of the SYNCO PATH program as a highly advanced machine with an overactive imagination. Traverse a maze of technological and industrial nightmares in a quest to uncover the truth hidden within your own memories. What could be more terrifying than being alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/cbb7aa68e7e992597668c771a7198c69.poster.avif?t=1754921123\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/cbb7aa68e7e992597668c771a7198c69.webm?t=1754921123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/cbb7aa68e7e992597668c771a7198c69.mp4?t=1754921123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reject Determined Destiny: </strong>From your prison cell, dive into a world gripped by the algorithmic control of the globe spanning Stagnation Protocol. What does it mean to secure a future and what must one do to determine their own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/4396dff0e877d8ee77494515aa86f26f.poster.avif?t=1754921123\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/4396dff0e877d8ee77494515aa86f26f.webm?t=1754921123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/4396dff0e877d8ee77494515aa86f26f.mp4?t=1754921123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove yourself of sound mind: </strong>Dream, draw, and use your wits and tools to unravel the complex mystery that lies at the root of your occupancy. In this austere prison only one code matters. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is far more than what the mind perceives.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/351d0dff9394c49cd6095a02ae8f6437.poster.avif?t=1754921123\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/351d0dff9394c49cd6095a02ae8f6437.webm?t=1754921123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/351d0dff9394c49cd6095a02ae8f6437.mp4?t=1754921123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And no one is ever truly alone...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
